@base = http://localhost:8086

### Lab 6: empty English form, 200 HTML
GET {{base}}/books/new?lang=en

### Russian form; the HTTP client retains the session cookie
GET {{base}}/books/new?lang=ru

### Required title, early year, missing genre, author digits and bad ISBN: 200 with errors, no save
POST {{base}}/books?lang=en
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=&author=Bloch+2018&year=1200&genre=&available=true&isbn=9780134685992

### The same errors in Russian
POST {{base}}/books?lang=ru
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=&author=Bloch+2018&year=1200&genre=&available=true&isbn=9780134685992

### Conversion error: rejected year text stays in BindingResult; 200 form with errors
POST {{base}}/books?lang=en
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Retained+title&author=Joshua+Bloch&year=not-a-year&genre=PROGRAMMING&isbn=

### Invalid ISBN checksum: 200 form with its own ISBN error
POST {{base}}/books?lang=en
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Effective+Java+Companion&author=Joshua+Bloch&year=2018&genre=PROGRAMMING&available=true&isbn=9780134685992

### Correct EAN-13 checksum but not an ISBN prefix: rejected
POST {{base}}/books?lang=en
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Effective+Java+Companion&author=Joshua+Bloch&year=2018&genre=PROGRAMMING&isbn=4006381333931

### Valid ISBN-13: 302 to /books, then GET 200 with one flash message
# Disable automatic redirect following to inspect the initial 302 separately.
POST {{base}}/books?lang=en
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Effective+Java+Companion&author=Joshua+Bloch&year=2018&genre=PROGRAMMING&available=true&isbn=9780134685991

### Optional blank ISBN also passes; unchecked availability defaults to false
POST {{base}}/books?lang=en
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Java+Precisely&author=Peter+Sestoft&year=2016&genre=PROGRAMMING&isbn=

### GET after redirect or refresh: no additional record is created
GET {{base}}/books

### Existing detail page: 200 HTML
GET {{base}}/books/1

### Central page advice: 404 and text/html
GET {{base}}/books/999?lang=en
Accept: text/html

### Central API advice: 404 and application/problem+json
GET {{base}}/api/books/999?lang=en
Accept: application/json

### The localized problem uses this URI as instance, without the query string
GET {{base}}/api/books/999?lang=ru
Accept: application/json

### Unsupported API response media type is still 406
GET {{base}}/api/books/999
Accept: application/xml

### Retained Lab 5 list and author fragment/limit
GET {{base}}/api/books?author=Bloch&limit=1
Accept: application/json

### Retained Lab 5 single-book success
GET {{base}}/api/books/1

### REST create: 201 plus Location; supplied body ID is ignored
POST {{base}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":1,"title":"Pro Spring 6","author":"Cosmina","year":2023}

### Replace the known seeded record: path ID wins, 200
PUT {{base}}/api/books/2
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":999,"title":"Clean Code Revised","author":"Robert Martin","year":2025}

### Delete the seeded record: 204
DELETE {{base}}/api/books/2

### Repeated deletion: 404
DELETE {{base}}/api/books/2

### Retained Lab 5 title search: 200 with matches or an empty array
GET {{base}}/api/books/search?title=JAVA

### Non-numeric path ID: 400
GET {{base}}/api/books/abc

### Unknown URL: 404
GET {{base}}/api/nothing

### Wrong collection method: 405
DELETE {{base}}/api/books

### Wrong request media type: 415
POST {{base}}/api/books
Content-Type: text/plain

This is not JSON.
